The French Dispatch of the Liberty, Kansas Evening Sun is a
drama, comedy film directed by Wes Anderson.

2
00:08:38,399 --> 00:08:44,399
The staff of an American magazine based in France puts out its last issue, with stories featuring an
artist sentenced to life imprisonment, student riots, and a kidnapping resolved by a chef.

